A run the client plays (host/session.inc). The verifier lays out no perk prompt, so a click in a tick never opens
the menu; the run takes a click on it between ticks. The perk choice reaches the run as a command with its next
tick, which applies it as the verifier does. Escape asks the run for the pause menu: the pending state is
simulation state, which only ticks write. The console's flag pauses parts of a tick: a run keeps it closed.
